    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们说好只是玩玩，说好顺其自然，说好成年人之间互不干涉。</span></p><p><span>只是自由和落寞之间，到底要怎么换算？</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 成年人的终极关系是互为客户</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 和最熟悉的陌生人相处，只有一个‘忍’字</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 当我们不再执着于给关系分类</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 我在他乡交了一个笔友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 短择是更自由的选择吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> Situationship原来是资本主义的阴谋？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 为什么situationship如此受欢迎？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 我们背对背拥抱，双人床间隔着一片海</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 玩归玩，闹归闹，道上也有道上的规矩</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie&nbsp;</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b"><span>@麦给给</span></a></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>The Vaccines – Want You So Bad</span></p></li><li><p><span>刘若英 - 一辈子的孤单</span></p></li><li><p><span>Horsebeach – My Heart Longs for You, Pizza</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOSKcmjFN03vwwm9QHX9U9bcIYY.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
