  <item>
    <title>EP71. 保持勇气，真的很需要勇气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9d7d0df03e74ee6b060208</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9d7d0df03e74ee6b060208</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>勇气是一种，玄之又玄的东西，就像所有游戏打到最后会发现，终极boss原来都是我自己。</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 谁不是从小被逼着“练胆”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> “与众不同”需要多少勇气？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 成长阵痛三件套：搬家、换工作、分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 勇气和勇敢的区别是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 我们就这样被生活逼成难缠的女人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 生活中重拳出击，爱情中唯唯诺诺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 承认自己其实不快乐，需要消耗大量的勇气token</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a> 单向表白到底算不算一种勇敢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 害怕的事情，和我的年龄一样与日俱增</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2261">37:41</a> 活到今天，我还是不敢麻烦别人</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie&nbsp;</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b"><span>@麦给给</span></a></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>火星电台 - ZOO</span></p></li><li><p><span>梁静茹 – 勇气</span></p></li><li><p><span>Charlotte Day Wilson, BADBADNOTGOOD - I Can Only Whisper</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOSKcmjFN03vwwm9QHX9U9bcIYY.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
