    <title>EP70. 烂约会，你别跟我闹了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8a9782ef65145dfcc3e27c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8a9782ef65145dfcc3e27c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家喜闻乐见的烂约会第二集来了，谁在伤疤上舞蹈，谁又在笑？</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 被dating app伤害的一生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> aa男，我命令你们消失</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 远离有毒的男子气概，人人有责</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 被来自迈阿密的男人味熏到了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 再约我在你家楼下见面试试？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 小众欧洲国家的留子，我真的怕你们。。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 一个夜晚，见两个极品，Vera从此以后开始闭关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 不回消息就大破防的马来男</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 弟弟好，弟弟香</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 爱情和面包真的可以兼得吗？</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie&nbsp;</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb081642040