    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>与天争，与地斗，与人吵，其乐无穷也。</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 路怒everyday，骑车开车打车都在生气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> 呵呵，工作内容就是跟人吵架</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 喜提客户投诉是一种什么体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> 海关和空乘，我到底怎么你们了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 谁在公共交通上没有过摩擦，谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> 两湖人民脾气真的太差了。。。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 我和我的疯狂妈妈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 你是哪种吵架人格？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> 能不能立法，禁止情侣跟单身的朋友玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 三人行，是真的不行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2819">46:59</a> 趁还有精力的时候，吵吧。。。</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie&nbsp;</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec3956