  <item>
    <title>EP66. 大城市的社交，我真的玩不转</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4287282e335a35a80b5f7a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4287282e335a35a80b5f7a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你在高楼大厦间穿梭，上海、香港、北京、伦敦，从不倦怠。你会寒暄，懂社交，偶尔逗得所有人开怀大笑，只是你从没忘记自己从哪来，也还不知道该往哪去。</span></p><ul><li><p><span>珑珑AI：一款无广告、纯科学的美妆护肤护发 AI 小程序</span></p></li></ul><p><span>扫描下方二维码，或微信搜索</span><strong><span>「珑珑AI」</span></strong><span>即可体验 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsljC-tLPspgzWqK96bqVqA4zzWC.jpg"><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 不说沪语在上海判几年？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 听说...潮人们其实都面冷心善？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 闯荡播客圈的二三事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 香港和北京，孰busy？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 混商务局，就像小孩坐在了大人的饭桌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 有城市病的我们，何去何从</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> 一些社交注意事项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2558">42:38</a> 我们能交到多少朋友，也许命运早已写好了答案</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie&nbsp;</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b"><span>@麦给给</span></a></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>Tame Impala - Not My World</span></p></li><li><p><span>汪峰 - 北京北京 </span></p></li><li><p><span>张悬 - 如何</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4zTM2mqBycOrgceOkSgd0snQxb.png"><p></p>]]></description>
