  <item>
    <title>EP65. 史炎：段子可以重来，当爸不行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2129797444b57222333c57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2129797444b57222333c57</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>所有人起立，列阵，欢迎</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1452977132" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1452977132"><span>@史炎</span></a><span>来女生宿舍串门！</span></p><p><span>这次我们以女儿的身份，邀请（强迫）这位主持着三档播客的脱口秀演员，大聊当爹的笑与泪，以及经营亲子关系那些事。</span></p><p><span>老爸们，父亲节快乐~</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 播客是男人们的客厅吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> shout out to AI时代还在坚持手搓的我们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 播客之神降临是一种什么样的感受？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 取名字嘛，梦到哪个叫哪个</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 面对父亲身份的转换</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 我们和史炎的五年之约，你们来见证</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> 爸爸到底该怎么爱女儿？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 那些说不出口的爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 从父女关系到亲密关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 无条件的爱是诅咒吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 今天父亲在我们生命中扮演着什么角色？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3326">55:26</a> 直到我接受平庸，慢慢老去</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">01:00:16</a> 硬件衰老VS软件衰老</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3921">01:05:21</a> 保持表达就像扒火车，而我们是为了上车一直裸奔的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">01:08:09</a> 史炎的男生宿舍时期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4438">01:13:58</a> 父辈们的故事，请别轻易忘记</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrT_YzWTHc5D6ii7_yEyVtc06jPu.jpg"><p><em><span>聊到后面真喝多了......</span></em></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie </span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b"><span>@麦给给</span></a></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「嘉宾」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>史炎，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61791d921989541784257779" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61791d921989541784257779"><span>@不开玩笑</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a2678ae29aab785c2ec367" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a2678ae29aab785c2ec367"><span>@A座B座</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643d5699ea2628837e622346" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643d5699ea2628837e622346"><span>@都在酒里了</span></a><span> 主播</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>Gatsby in a Daze - Home</span></p></li><li><p><span>高旗&amp;超载乐队 - 如果我现在死去 (Live)</span></p></li><li><p><span>木马Muma - Feifei Run</span></p></li><li><p><span>许飞 - 父亲写的散文诗</span></p></li><li><p><span>Coldplay - Daddy</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4zTM2mqBycOrgceOkSgd0snQxb.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
