    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们总是会在电光火石间，冒出一些鬼点子，想薅羊毛、想走捷径、想偷个懒......</span></p><p><span>哎，那些自作聪明的瞬间，和这弄巧成拙的人生。</span></p><p><strong><span>「SHOWNOTE」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> 在ktv点酒的外卖判几年？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 我们和club保安的爱恨纠葛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 省钱就是，在上海街头拎着8只水饺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 我看谁听完以后国际快递还敢走海运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 我本是那粗笨的女子，天生做不来手工活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 有时候工作上真的不能耍小聪明。。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 过期羊毛如砒霜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 铁，人与人之间的信任都去哪了？</span></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Vera </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1841154352"><span>@荔枝角公園H</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575509ec82ec395600012707?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724685815&amp;share_id=5f91a8fbe80a4672bd4b51e3f7116226"><span>@井</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Maggie </span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iDGpW5Qb/%204@8.com"><span>@麦给给</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55d46a0ce4b1cf7107d32505?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=575509ec82ec395600012707&amp;apptime=1724686378&amp;share_id=bc51404fa72a4cb0816420407c9aaf7b"><span>@麦给给</span></a></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>Saint Etienne - Only Love Can Break Your Heart</span></p></li><li><p><span>五条人 - 问题出现我再告诉大家</span></p></li><li><p><span>Benny Sings - Here It Comes</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4zTM2mqBycOrgceOkSgd0snQxb.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
